# orig-boot — run the ORIGINAL firmware binary unmodified (canonical run).
#
# Sessions 45-47 state: the original's OS boots and RUNS (context switches
# flow, the tick advances, the first protocol frame "$A00" goes out on
# USART2). Harness-side workarounds, all model-gap equivalents (restate in
# every equivalence report):
#   1. SYST_CVR=0 at t=10 ms - Renode's descending SysTick LimitTimer with
#      CURRENT=0 first fires at 0xFFFFFF/fclk; silicon wraps in ~1 tick.
#   2. r9 := 0x08040000 at the init-walker entry - the armlink loader's
#      'add r5, r9' pointer fixup needs the scatter base; Renode reset
#      leaves r9=0, so table pointers lost their 0x0804 prefix.
#   3. gpioPortB removed from the platform (see gd32f103.repl header) -
#      the software-I2C ACK read must return 0 or the settings-EEPROM
#      driver wedges the boot in a NAK-retry storm.
#   4. ADC2_SR tagged 0x2 (EOC) - the boot polls adc_flag_get(ADC2, EOC).
#   5. SPI2 = sp2_fontflash.py - the font-flash stand-in (reads 0xFF).
#
# NEXT (CK2): the "$A00" handshake on USART2 awaits a peer - the 8051-link
# protocol responder (play the tests/test_protocol.c conformance vectors).

using sysbus
mach create "hguv98-orig"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @/home/sslayer/Proyectos/HG-UV98/reconstruction/sim/gd32f103.repl

# bootloader-equivalent handoff from the ORIGINAL's own vector table
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x00000000 0x20006780
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x00000004 0x08044691

# SystemInit's SCLK_STS poll (same vendor code as the reconstruction)
sysbus Tag <0x40021004, 0x40021007> "RCC_CFGR" 0x00000008

sysbus LoadBinary @/home/sslayer/Proyectos/HG-UV98/firmware/MAIN-MCU-HG-UV98-V1.0.1-190416.bin 0x08004000

# the armlink scatter base (session 47)
cpu AddHook 0x08042900 "from Antmicro.Renode.Peripherals.CPU import RegisterValue; self.SetRegister(9, RegisterValue.Create(0x08040000, 32))"

# protocol UART output (USART2 = the 8051 link) to the console
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

echo "=== boot 10 ms (decompressor + SystemInit + main + OSStart) ==="
emulation RunFor "00:00:00.010"

sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0xE000E018 0x00000000

echo "=== run 2 s (OS tick + tasks + first $A00 frame) ==="
emulation RunFor "00:00:01.990"
echo "=== OSCtxSwCtr (0x200050EC):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x200050EC
echo "=== OSTime (0x2000511C):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x2000511C
echo "=== fault registers (must stay 0):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0xE000ED28
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0xE000ED2C
quit
